{
  "id": "ACT.20",
  "number": "20",
  "bookId": "ACT",
  "reference": "Huji Ergattu 20",
  "verseCount": 38,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "20",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ACT 20"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "20",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 20:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eegi gohanti ch'aamte, Pauloni gumi Yeso wolti yaame gorse nagaya d'aamate kae Makedonia d'aqe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.20.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 20:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lafa suni keesa dedeeme gumi guddo gorse lafa Griki d'aqe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.20.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jia sadii achi tae. Shamu hobolooni d'aqisa kaanaani, aka Yahudiini d'ossaani isa eedu d'agaye; duuba aka kara Makedoniatiini galu kutate. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.20.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 20:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sopatroni ilmi Piro ka dira Beroya d'ufe isa gula deeme ammalle jari kunileeni isa gula yae; Aristakofi Sekundo, worra lafa Thesaloniketifi Gayo lafa Derbetifi Timotheofi Tikikofi Trofimo, worra Asia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.20.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jari kunini nu dura dabre lafa Troati nu eege. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Guyyaani Qit'a bukho inqamne dabarraani nu Filipi hobolooni kaane, eegi bulti shani Troati worra d'aqamne, haga bulti torba achi teenne.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.20.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Waan d'aqacha Eutiko",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.20.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 20:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Guyya qara ka torbaani nu woli woldeenne qit'a ch'absine. Pauloni worrati hasae, aka kaisa boriyyaati kurfefatu haga saa jaa ka halkani hasae. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.20.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.20.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 20:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Fulla nu wolti woldeenne ta mana gubba suni keesa ifse hedduti jira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.20.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.20.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 20:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nami kaima toko ka Eutiko jed'ani fulla dirisha tae; waan Pauloni guddo hasaeefi inni muge, haga mana sadeeso ka gubbati d'aqate lafa d'ae, isa due lafaa fuud'ani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.20.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.20.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 20:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pauloni gadibue isati gadijed'e, iti mamarate waan jed'e, Inahiina, inni indoone. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.20.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.20.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 20:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eegi inni oldeebie qit'a ch'abse nyaate, haga baraaqa d'eereese hasae, duuba kae deeme. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.20.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.20.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 20:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Worri kaani kaima kaani ka jiru fuud'ani garaa jabaatani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.20.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.20.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Imaltu gara Mileto",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 20:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.20.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.20.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 20:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pauloni haga Aso miilaani deemaa kanaani, Hobolooni koota arti na fuud'a nuuni jed'e, duuba nu hobolooni dabare Aso yaane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.20.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.20.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 20:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inni Asoti nuuni baanaani, hobolo keesa isa keenne Mitilene deemne. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.20.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.20.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 20:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hobolooni achi kaane boriyya Kio d'umne. Iftaani Samo d'umne, iftaani achaantu Mileto geenne. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.20.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.20.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 20:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pauloni aka hobolooni Efeso biraa dabru kutate, maro Asia keesati turu imfeeneefi. Inni arifate aka yo dandae, ato guyyaani Pentekoste ingahiini Yerusalemu gahu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.20.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.20.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "D'aamsa Paulo gara jaarole lafa Efeso",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 20:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.20.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.20.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 20:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ato Mileto jiru, inni nama gara Efeso erge jaarole gumi Waaqaa yaame. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.20.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.20.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 20:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Worri gara Paulo d'ufe duuba inni waan worraani jed'e: Haga guyya qara ka anini Asia d'ufe, aka anini oole bule imbeetani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.20.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.20.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 20:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaafa Yahudiini na gaargalchite na ijeesu feete, ufi diqeese imimaani bohe huji Aabbo hojad'e. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.20.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.20.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 20:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ammalle waan isani olaana tokole inhambimne, ato isanii agarsiise barsiisu, nama duraafi maneeni teesani keesaleti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.20.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.20.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 20:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anini Yahudifi gosa d'ibileti layu hime, aka daba lakisani Waaqati deebiani Aabbo Yeso d'ugefatani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.20.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.20.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 20:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amma anini gara Yerusalemu d'aquu jira, waan Lubbuuni Qulqullooni na deemsifteefi; ammo waan achiti tahu imbeekhu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.20.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.20.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 20:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anini imbeekha, Lubbuuni Qulqullooni ya nati himte, dira ch'ufa keesa hid'aansafi gaargalati na eegata. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.20.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.20.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 20:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2TI.4.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Tim 4.7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ammo anini jireenna kiyya inheregu, waan dansale insehu, aka anini deema tiyya gammadaani hobaase huji tiyya ta Aabbo Yesoni naa kenne, ta Odu Dansa ta eeba Waaqa d'ugeesu guutu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.20.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.20.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 20:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.20.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.20.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 20:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anini imbeekha, aka isaaniini ch'ufti, ka anini jiddu teesaniti Finna Waaqa hasae, fuula kiyya deebitani ingarre. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.20.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.20.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 20:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tanaafi anini guyya kana isani durati hima, aka d'iigi nama tokoleeni na gubbaa injirre. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.20.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.20.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 20:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anini fed'i Waaqa tokole isani ind'ossine. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.20.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.20.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 20:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tanaafi ufiifi hooliye Lubbuuni Qulqullooni isaniti kennitele qorqorad'a, aka gumi Aabbo ta inni d'iiga ufitiini bitate nyaachiftani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.20.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.20.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 20:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anini imbeekha aka eegi anini deeme, yeyiini hamtuuni jiddu teesani d'ufte hooliye fit'u. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.20.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.20.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 20:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ammalle jiddu teesani keesa namati d'ufa, ka waan hamtu dubbatu, aka gumi Yeso ufi gula deebisu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
